# The cart track through the meadow east of the tavern (reports/engine/2026-11-15-meadow-road): the road's own
# views, in still air. The camera spots stand on the road's middle line as the chunks of the base have it (survey of
# the note): change them only with the note.
#   track-along   standing on the track, the game's camera along it up the slope
#   game-verge-across, meadow-2, far   the views of landscape-meadow.bench where the road's tone is measured
#   track-low     70 cm over the track: a rut, the crust and its stones
#   track-cross, track-cross-2, track-end   the T-cross from the game's camera, another from 2.5 m above, the end piece
#   track-path05  the footpath PATH_05 up to its turn into the track
#   track-rock, track-sweet   the same road texture outside the meadow: at the rock and in the sweet grass
#   track-along-eve, track-down-eve, track-low-eve   19:30: the sun behind the camera, then against it, then the rut
# cover-<view>: the ground painted by its cover (`grass parts 256`: the road's crust blue, its loose earth cyan, the
# verge's strip magenta to orange, the meadow's sward green and earth red) - the mask the road's tone is read by;
# <view>-16384: the road as with its `verge` alone (`grass parts 16384`) - what the track's own material changes.
# Run it for «было» and «стало» with the same scenario:
#   OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<set> TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh landscape-meadow-road
# @timeout 600
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode run
watch player
cam game
set time 12 0
cloth wind calm

goto pos 41940 3300 -317
clear 3000
face -122
streaming wait
grass wait
wait 5000
shot track-along
wait 200
grass parts 256
wait 1200
shot cover-track-along
wait 200
grass parts 16384
wait 1200
shot track-along-16384
wait 200
grass parts 0

goto pos 41701 3320 795
face 0
grass wait
wait 5000
shot game-verge-across
wait 200
grass parts 256
wait 1200
shot cover-game-verge-across
wait 200
grass parts 16384
wait 1200
shot game-verge-across-16384
wait 200
grass parts 0

